display_name.description:
Player-facing identity like `fw-01` / `ids-01` / `lb-01` (per-kind
sequence). Empty on saves whose appliances were never named;
clients fall back to `kind` + `id`.

pool_id.description:
Host-pool membership. `0` means the General pool (`Host.pool_id == None`);
otherwise the `HostPoolView.id` this host belongs to. Delta-encoded:
it only changes when the player reassigns the host. Resolve the name via `WorldSnapshot.host_pools`.

indicator.description:
MAC flapping (2+ unbonded cables switch↔gateway) surfaces via the amber
`indicator` below + the MacFlapDetected event / MacFlapping incident;
there is no dedicated wire bool.
